  "details": "When using a game controller in desktop mode a tooltip shows at the top saying to hold RB to fly the camera, however pressing and holding the RB on the controller just brings up the gesture change wheels.\n\nThe only way to get fly mode to work when using a controller is to also hold the middle button of the mouse, which defeats the purpose of using the controller.\n\nPlease fix this so that when using the camera the gesture wheels do not appear and fly most actually works when holding RB on the controller",
